OL,3,GNEWSABlue plaque unveiled at ex-England
OL,4,Astriker's home                         
OL,6,FHalifax Civic Trust, which organised   
OL,7,Fthe plaque, said it was a day to       
OL,8,Fcelebrate Worthington's outstanding    
OL,9,Fcontribution to football and his place 
OL,10,Fin the town's heritage.                
